{
 "name": "amd_nov5",
 "description": "Generate specs/amd_nov5.json: Unsloth Studio (main) vs ComfyUI v0.44.0 on gfx1151 (Strix Halo, Linux ROCm), bf16.\n\nEvery ComfyUI file is built on the runner from the OFFICIAL model repos by amd/nov5_prep.py (klein, f3, zimg, q21)\nand convert_comfy.py (Wan2.2-TI2V-5B); nothing comes from a Comfy-Org / comfyanonymous Hugging Face repo. Studio\nreads the same official snapshots (DBENCH_MODEL_<ALIAS> set by the prep step), so both stacks run the same weights.\n\nArms per family (tag = <fam>_<arm>):\n  s_def     Studio main defaults, its own gfx1151 torch (repo.amd.com 2.11 + ROCm 7.13); no flash_attn importable\n            (flash-attention is installed with pip --target into a separate dir that only the flash arms put on\n            sys.path, via DBENCH_EXTRA_SYSPATH in run_cell.py)\n  s_flash   s_def + DAO-AILab flash-attention (Triton AMD backend) importable: attention auto (what shipping it gives)\n  s_flashx  s_flash with attention_backend=\"flash\" (explicit)\n  s_pt72n   Studio main in a venv on download.pytorch.org torch 2.14.1+rocm7.2 (ComfyUI README torch)\n  c_rock    ComfyUI v0.44.0 on Studio's torch (same torch as s_def), default flags\n  c_def     ComfyUI v0.44.0, README ROCm install (download.pytorch.org rocm7.2 -> 2.14.1), default flags\n  c_nockhip c_rock + COMFY_KITCHEN_DISABLE_HIP=1 (comfy-kitchen fused HIP kernels off: isolates their share)\n  s_pt72n_flash  s_pt72n + the flash-attention dir (both Studio levers stacked)\n  *_2_repeat     A/A copies of s_def, s_flash and c_rock (noise floor)\n",
 "models": {
  "flux2_klein_4b": {
   "repo": "black-forest-labs/FLUX.2-klein-4B",
   "download": {
    "ignore": [
     "*.png",
     "*.jpg"
    ]
   }
  },
  "flux3_klein": {
   "repo": "unsloth/flux-3-image-klein",
   "download": {
    "ignore": [
     "*.png",
     "*.jpg",
     "variants/*"
    ]
   }
  },
  "zimage_turbo": {
   "repo": "Tongyi-MAI/Z-Image-Turbo",
   "download": {
    "ignore": [
     "*.png",
     "*.jpg",
     "*.webp",
     "assets/*"
    ]
   }
  },
  "qwen_image_21": {
   "repo": "Qwen/Qwen-Image-2.1",
   "download": {
    "ignore": [
     "*.png",
     "*.jpg"
    ]
   }
  },
  "wan22_5b": {
   "repo": "Wan-AI/Wan2.2-TI2V-5B-Diffusers",
   "download": {
    "ignore": [
     "*.png",
     "*.jpg",
     "*.gif",
     "*.mp4",
     "assets/*",
     "examples/*"
    ]
   }
  }
 },
 "defaults": {
  "backend": "studio",
  "kind": "image",
  "prompts": "image_24",
  "n": 2,
  "warmup": 1,
  "short_n": 0,
  "options": {
   "local_files_only": true
  }
 },
 "gate": {
  "max_util": 15,
  "min_free_mib": 0,
  "timeout_s": 600
 },
